    "body": "> [<img alt=\"ulfgebhardt\" height=\"40\" width=\"40\" align=\"left\" src=\"https://avatars1.githubusercontent.com/u/38261864?s=88&v=4\">](https://github.com/ulfgebhardt) **Authored by [ulfgebhardt](https://github.com/ulfgebhardt)**\n_<time datetime=\"2019-04-04T15:50:35Z\" title=\"Thursday, April 4th 2019, 5:50:35 pm +02:00\">Apr 4, 2019</time>_\n_Closed <time datetime=\"2019-06-14T16:45:31Z\" title=\"Friday, June 14th 2019, 6:45:31 pm +02:00\">Jun 14, 2019</time>_\n---\n\n## 🚀 Feature\n<!-- Describe the Feature. -->\n### UserSettings - Delete Account & Data\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1238238/55569372-bed93300-5701-11e9-8b30-81cd56862388.png)\n\n- [ ] Confirm slider\n- [ ] Delete Button + Functionality\n\nNote: It could be sufficient to send an email if the delete functionality is provided to an admin\n\n### Userstory\n```\nFeature: Delete own account and content\n  As a user\n  I'd like to delete all my data, ie. posts, comments, shouts, follows\n  Because I have a \"right to be forgotten\"\n```\n\n### Design & Layout - Alpha\n<!-- Attach Screenshots and Drawings. -->\n![Screenshot at 2019-06-04 19:35:58.png](https://images.zenhubusercontent.com/5ac663b44b5806bc2bcdd1d7/e0818ed3-1d02-42c7-9a4f-48a340d0b87a)\n\n### Design & Layout - Nitro\n<!-- Attach Screenshots and Drawings. -->\nNot implemented:\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/1238238/55569449-e6300000-5701-11e9-875b-b2bbe347a4a2.png)\n",
